      "content": "art.\n17\ndesta\nLei C\no\nm\npl\ne\nm\ne\nntar, \r\nas\nse\ng\nuintes\nativid\na\ndes\nde\np\nr\nestaçăo\nde\nserviç\no\ns\nse\nr\năo tributadas\nn\na\nf\nor\nm\na\ndo\nAnexo\nIII\nd\nesta\nLei C\no\nm\np\nl\ne\nm\nenta\nr\n:\n...........................................................................................\n§\n5\nş\n-F.\nAs\nat\ni\nvidades\nd\ne\nprestaçăo\nde\nservi\nç\nos\nre\nf\neridas no\n§\n2\no\ndo art.\n17\ndesta\nLei\nC\no\nmpl\ne\nm\nentar\nserăo\ntr\ni\nbu\nt\nadas\nna\nf\nor\nm\na\ndo\nAn\ne\nxo \r\nIII\ndesta\nLei\nC\no\nm\npl\nem\nentar,\nsalvo\nse,\npara\na\nl\ng\nu\nm\na\ndessas\nati\nv\nidad\ne\ns, \r\nhouver\nprev\ni\nsăo\nexpr\ne\ns\nsa\nde\ntributaç\nă\no\nna\nf\nor\nm\na\nd\nos\nAne\nx\nos\nIV\nou\nV desta\nLei\nCo\nm\npl\ne\nmen\nt\nar.\n.............................................................................................\n§ 5\nş\n-I\n.\nS\ne\nm\npreju\ní\nzo\ndo\ndisp\no\nsto\nn\no\n§ 1\no\ndo",
